                                                "sense_id": "90076c17-4f3b-3969-ab85-cf81c4f17b5d",
                                                "text": "The accommodations at that hotel were quite luxurious."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8d1fe4d-a021-3a8d-92fd-909ecba82cb6",
                                        "entry_id": "3a3c2981-935d-34d1-919b-d7f5dc2a3625",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adaptation or adjustment.",
                                            "The act of fitting or adapting, or the state of being fitted or adapted; adaptation; adjustment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "physical",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "with-to"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f9bc5b-ef70-4fb3-9b31-55e07c5ac66d",
                                                "sense_id": "e8d1fe4d-a021-3a8d-92fd-909ecba82cb6",
                                                "text": "It is true, the organization of the humane and animal Body, with accommodation to their several functions and offices, is certainly fitted with the most curious and exact Mechanism imaginable"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b978d63-d090-3759-9a31-e39b821268c3",
                                        "entry_id": "3a3c2981-935d-34d1-919b-d7f5dc2a3625",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adaptation or adjustment.",
                                            "A convenience, a fitting, something satisfying a need."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "physical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bf57321-fc13-40dc-9bb3-6f2973b53dca",
                                                "sense_id": "4b978d63-d090-3759-9a31-e39b821268c3",
                                                "text": "...and Lady Anne, for the present, felt as if Fanchette and her coach full of accommodations, heavy as they might once be supposed to be, were suddenly swallowed up in that awful sea, to which so many refractory spirits have been exorcised and consigned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c453d42f-b27d-4bf6-b7f0-c6cfd02dfa38",
                                                "sense_id": "4b978d63-d090-3759-9a31-e39b821268c3",
                                                "text": "Mr. Cooke had had a sloop yacht built at Far Harbor, the completion of which had been delayed, and which was but just delivered. […] The Maria had a cabin, which was finished in hard wood and yellow plush, and accommodations for keeping things cold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d3baea6-05b4-3065-9c9e-e11fcfa9829e",
                                        "entry_id": "3a3c2981-935d-34d1-919b-d7f5dc2a3625",
                                        "glosses": [
